From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:34:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] GE thread: SPSC job ring (gpu::GeWorker), host interrupt
 mailbox in the kernel, threaded lists/flips/DrawSync/ListSync in hle_media,
 ge_replay --threaded

The list walk, the GL submission and the flips run on a thread of their own, the guest on another; perf.threaded_renderer (settings.txt) or <PREFIX>_THREADED_RENDERER switches it. Not yet built for the Vita or run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

